sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  box rgb(246,248,250) GitHub · church repository
    participant Job as Upload job<br/>store-upload environment, main
    participant OIDC as GitHub identity tokens
  end
  box rgb(240,250,243) Google Cloud · sda-church-app-play · free, no billing account
    participant STS as Security Token Service API
    participant Pool as Workload identity pool "github"<br/>provider "sda-church-app"
    participant Creds as IAM Service Account<br/>Credentials API
  end
  box rgb(240,246,255) Google Play
    participant Play as Google Play Android<br/>Developer API
    participant Track as Internal testing track
  end

  Job->>OIDC: Ask for an identity token<br/>(the job has id-token: write)
  OIDC-->>Job: Signed token: repository ID,<br/>environment, and branch
  Job->>STS: Trade it, for the provider in<br/>GOOGLE_PLAY_WORKLOAD_IDENTITY_PROVIDER
  STS->>Pool: Does the token pass<br/>the provider's condition?
  Note over Pool: Only this repository's ID,<br/>the store-upload environment, and main
  Pool-->>STS: Yes
  STS-->>Job: Federated token
  Job->>Creds: Act as GOOGLE_PLAY_SERVICE_ACCOUNT<br/>(play-upload)
  Note over Creds: Allowed because the pool is a<br/>Workload Identity User on play-upload
  Creds-->>Job: play-upload token: Google Play only,<br/>expires within an hour
  Job->>Play: Upload the AAB, set the release<br/>name and "What's new", commit
  Note over Play: Play Console lets play-upload<br/>only release to testing tracks
  Play->>Track: Roll the release<br/>out to testers
  Note over Job,Track: No key is stored anywhere: every token expires within an hour.<br/>An admin promotes the release to production after testing.
